{:org/id :org-jpn-chonaikai
 :org/form-family :family-neighborhood-assembly
 :org/name "町内会・自治会 (Japanese neighborhood associations)"
 :org/name-en "Chonaikai / jichikai neighborhood associations"
 :org/entity-kind :org-form
 :org/category :cat-local-place
 :org/type :secular-community
 :org/scope :local-class
 :org/region-primary :region-asia-east
 :org/countries ["JP"]
 :org/founding-date 1940
 :org/founding-note "Consolidated nationally under wartime tonarigumi policy; abolished by GHQ 1947; re-formed voluntarily thereafter."
 :org/instance-count-estimate 290054
 :org/member-count-basis "source-pinned: 290,054 associations nationwide as of 2021-04-01 (総務省自治行政局市町村課 aggregation of all 1,741 municipalities). Household participation rate 71.8% in 2021, down from 78.0% in 2010 — 57.9% in cities over 500k population, 88.3% in municipalities under 10k. No absolute member-household total is published, so :org/member-count is deliberately not asserted (iteration 1 carried a recalled 30M figure that had no source)."
 :org/legal-registration :mostly-unregistered
 :org/registration-note "Most are voluntary bodies with no legal personality; a minority obtain 認可地縁団体 status under the Local Autonomy Act to hold property."
 :org/governance-model :consensus
 :org/mission-statement "Neighborhood self-management: festival and shrine support, waste-station upkeep, disaster preparedness, circulating notice board (回覧板), liaison with municipal government."
 :org/source-name "総務省自治行政局市町村課「自治会等に関する市区町村の取組についてのアンケート とりまとめ結果」"
 :org/source-url "https://www.soumu.go.jp/main_content/000808317.pdf"
 :org/source-date "2021-04-01"
 :org/source-tier :secondary
 :org/source-caveat "The 総務省 PDF is image-based and could not be machine-parsed; the 290,054 / 71.8% figures were taken from summaries of that aggregation. Re-pin as :primary if the PDF is OCR'd."
 :org/pinned-on "2026-07-25"
 :org/data-provenance "source-pinned"
 :source/dataset "community-coverage"}

